      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "@{5a565acbb301553d0104ba88|full_name} yeah it's a bug VRChat are aware of, but they failed to consider the safety implications of. Something seemingly long-standing which only applies to Avatars too, not worlds.\n\nThis makes me think it's the SDK stripping the station out when disabled, or some other instantiation tom-foolery.\n\nWhich is why I filed this under \"Safety\" — It genuinely results in unwanted interactions that go against the safety system by being default-on.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    }
